    "description": {
      "content": "## Introduction\nThe MT PASA Offers API allows Scheduled Generators, Market Customers, Market Network Service Providers, and Integrated Resource Providers to submit their MT PASA Offers for Bi-directional Units (BDU), Scheduled Generation Units (SGU), Scheduled Load Units (SLU), and Scheduled Network Services (SNS). MT PASA Offers are input into the MT PASA process.",
